title Grid Balancing Act Business Process

participant Kong
participant "Grid Balancing Service" as Grid
participant "AssetLink Service" as AssetLink
participant "Telemetry Service" as Telemetry
participant Kafka
participant Database

note over Kong,Database: Triggered by POST /GridBalancing/act/{recommendationId}

Kong->Grid: Forward Request
activate Grid

Grid->Database: Load recommendation\n(deficitZoneId, surplusZoneId)
Database-->Grid: Zone names

Grid->Database: Resolve utilityOperatorId\nfor surplus and deficit zones
Database-->Grid: surplusOpId, deficitOpId

Grid->AssetLink: GET /AssetLink
AssetLink-->Grid: All active links

note right of Grid: Find first AssetLink\nwith idUtilityOperator = surplusOpId


Grid->AssetLink: DELETE /AssetLink/{surplusAssetLinkId}
activate AssetLink
AssetLink->Kafka: Delete Kafka topic\n(surplusAssetLinkId-operatorName)
AssetLink->Telemetry: DELETE /Telemetry/Consume/{topicName}
Telemetry-->AssetLink: 204 (consumer stopped)
AssetLink->Database: DELETE AssetLink record
Database-->AssetLink: OK
AssetLink-->Grid: 204 No Content
deactivate AssetLink


Grid->AssetLink: POST /AssetLink\n{idProsumer, idUtilityOperator: deficitOpId}
activate AssetLink
AssetLink->Database: INSERT AssetLink
AssetLink->Kafka: Create Kafka topic\n(newAssetLinkId-deficitOperatorName)
AssetLink->Telemetry: POST /Telemetry/Consume/{newTopicName}
Telemetry-->AssetLink: OK (consumer started)
AssetLink-->Grid: 201 Created
deactivate AssetLink

Grid->Database: SET actioned = true\nWHERE id = recommendationId
Database-->Grid: OK

Grid-->Kong: 200 OK\n{recommendationId, movedProsumerId, fromZone, toZone}
deactivate Grid
